  "solution": "The logic followed here is,\n\nLogic: **Second Number = (First Number + Third Number) × 2**\n\n**(4, 42, 17)**\n\n→ 42 = (4 + 17) × 2\n\n→ 42 = 21 × 2\n\n**(6, 86, 37) **\n\n→ 86 = (6 + 37) × 2\n\n→ 86 = 43 × 2\n\nNow, let's check each option,\n\n**1) (8, 164, 65) **\n\n→ 164 = (8 + 65) × 2\n\n→ 164 ≠ 73 × 2\n\n**2) (9, 180, 82)**\n\n→ 180 = (9 + 82) × 2\n\n→ 180 ≠ 91 × 2\n\n**3) (5, 52, 26) **\n\n→ 52 = (5 + 26) × 2\n\n→ 52 ≠ 31 × 2\n\n**4) (7, 114, 50) **\n\n→ 114 = (7 + 50) × 2\n\n→ 114 = 57 × 2 ⇒ **Satisfies the logic.**\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 4 satisfies the logic.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****(7, 114, 50)\"**.",
